{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141060/extras/b8586a9a52eaf22abe72aaf97ce8b2a6.avif?t=1761858926\" width=608 height=225 /></span><br><strong>WEEPING ANGELS CARVED INTO STONE CRY OUT FOR THEIR MAKERS, NOT KNOWING IT IS TOO LATE.<br>Count yourself lucky, Son of Drop.</strong> <br>Count yourself lucky that the breath of <i>Aphantasia</i> has yet to discover your presence.<br><br>Play as the <strong>Son of Drop</strong>, Roudert, on a questionable quest to rescue your good acquaintance,\u00a0<strong>The Mouse</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet friends and foes alike as you travel the island of <strong>Mollagit</strong>, featuring <strong>sub-par world-building</strong> and <strong>characters with abhorrent personalities</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore alongside <strong>Largo</strong>, the fastest purple-colored creature in Mollagit!<br>Fight beside <strong>Mustaeyed</strong>, a loyal Royal Guard and long-time friend of Roudert!<br>Also some <strong>big stinking loser</strong> called <strong>Caleidoface</strong> is there too</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your brave and crude journey, the <strong>choices you make as Roudert</strong> will shape the story.<br>(<i>Whoa! Just like real life!</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will become of these four slightly-below-average-but-on-occasion-just-average adventurers?<br><br>The choice is yours, <strong>Son of Drop</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4141060?t=1761858926","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141060/b41bd46c471e3eec5b883a1490bd76984c0ba676/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761858926","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141060/12bc82c51475f64da306665f65ee5b80c44be215/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761858926","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141060/12bc82c51475f64da306665f65ee5b80c44be215/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761858926","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Aphantasia has depictions of cartoon and fantasy violence where no blood is shown. Some included scenes reference self-harm and suicide."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141060/extras/b8586a9a52eaf22abe72aaf97ce8b2a6.avif?t=1761858926\" width=608 height=225 /></span><br><strong>WEEPING ANGELS CARVED INTO STONE CRY OUT FOR THEIR MAKERS, NOT KNOWING IT IS TOO LATE.<br>Count yourself lucky, Son of Drop.</strong> <br>Count yourself lucky that the breath of <i>Aphantasia</i> has yet to discover your presence.<br><br>Play as the <strong>Son of Drop</strong>, Roudert, on a questionable quest to rescue your good acquaintance,\u00a0<strong>The Mouse</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet friends and foes alike as you travel the island of <strong>Mollagit</strong>, featuring <strong>sub-par world-building</strong> and <strong>characters with abhorrent personalities</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore alongside <strong>Largo</strong>, the fastest purple-colored creature in Mollagit!<br>Fight beside <strong>Mustaeyed</strong>, a loyal Royal Guard and long-time friend of Roudert!<br>Also some <strong>big stinking loser</strong> called <strong>Caleidoface</strong> is there too</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your brave and crude journey, the <strong>choices you make as Roudert</strong> will shape the story.<br>(<i>Whoa! Just like real life!</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will become of these four slightly-below-average-but-on-occasion-just-average adventurers?<br><br>The choice is yours, <strong>Son of Drop</strong>.</p>","developers":["Pardusolet"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141060/c9feb6c3051d9d7936ecb5efb2a5a2a82c7edce1/header.jpg?t=1761858926","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Aphantasia","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/8.1/10 (32bit/64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo or equivalent or greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 9/OpenGL 4.1 capable GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Pardusolet"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nTemas sens\u00edveis\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Selbstmord\nDerbe Sprache","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"November 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141060/809261cc1768d580fad6c261a5c65e25441dbf35/ss_809261cc1768d580fad6c261a5c65e25441dbf35.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761858926","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141060/809261cc1768d580fad6c261a5c65e25441dbf35/ss_809261cc1768d580fad6c261a5c65e25441dbf35.600x338.jpg?t=1761858926"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141060/91b8b2303af30c768cdc46e966c2a7742bf03970/ss_91b8b2303af30c768cdc46e